title: Case Manager › Active cases › Units or days left and the run-out flag
route: /manager
intro: The 'Units or days' column of the tracker says how much of the approval is used, how much is left (worked out, not stored) and, only when the data shows it, that the approval runs out before the next review. The same words are on the ledger case page.
dir: TD
also: The pace is the demo's own: one day of care a day, and about three units a week for IOP (the case page dates the approval with the same pace). A real payer's day or unit count would replace it.
---
start s1 "Read the 'Units or days' cell of a tracker row"
decision d1 "Is the case approved yet?"
process n1 "'not yet approved' in grey\n(9 cases: admissions, retro-authorizations and first requests)"
process p1 "Left = total minus used, never below zero\nText '10 of 21 days used, 11 left'\n'units' for IOP, 'none left' at zero\nA thin bar under it, terracotta from 75 percent used"
process pc "Sorting this column ('Sort by Units or days') orders by the share used"

decision d2 "Are there units or days left, and a review still to be signed?"
process n2 "No flag\n(nothing left to run out, or no review to run out before)"
store st1 "Next review of the case = the earliest review not yet signed\nThe one due this week, or the one Cadence booked after a signature"
process pp "Pace of use: a day a day, about three units a week for IOP"
decision d3 "Does the ledger date the end of the approval?\n(an expiry or units clock that the case page has not replaced with its own)"
process e1p "End of the approval = that date"
process e2p "End of the approval = now + left divided by the pace"
decision d4 "Does the approval end before that review?"
process n3 "No flag"
screen f1 "'Runs out before review' in red under the bar\nNo pill: it is text\nAt the start one row shows it (P-1590: 2 days left, its review falls later in the week)"
screen f2 "The ledger case page says the same beside 'Units used'\n'10 of 12 days used, 2 left   Runs out before review'"
screen ft "Footnote under the table\n'Units or days left are worked out at the usual pace ... Runs out before review appears only when that pace uses the approval up before the next review.'"
process pm "Moves with the demo clock\nFast-forward and a signed review (which books the next one) can add or remove the flag"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases › What each tracker cell means"
goto g2 "Continues in: Case Manager › Ledger case › Open and read"
end e1 "Cell is read"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| n1 --> e1
d1 -->|Yes| p1 --> d2
p1 -.-> pc
d2 -->|No| n2 --> e1
d2 -->|Yes| st1 --> pp --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| e1p --> d4
d3 -->|No| e2p --> d4
d4 -->|No| n3 --> e1
d4 -->|Yes| f1 --> f2
f1 -.-> pm
f1 --> ft --> e1
f2 --> g2
p1 --> g1
